      ],
      "yaw": 0,
      "lines": [
        [
          "这里是从者们的生活馆。餐桌和休息区已经备好，随时可以进来歇一会儿。",
          "This residence is for our companions. The dining hall and rest rooms are ready; come in whenever you need a quiet moment."
        ],
        [
          "两侧是休息房间，后方书架收着各个时代留下的旅行笔记。",
          "Rest rooms are on either side. The shelves at the back hold travel notes from many eras."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "alpha"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha_archivist",
      "role": [
        "驻地记录员",
        "Residence Archivist"
      ],
      "position": [
        -169.2,
        10.058314018249511,
        207.8
      ],
      "yaw": 0,
      "lines": [
        [
          "每位同行者都有自己的故事。旅途结束后，不妨来这里听听他们的见闻。",
          "Every companion has a story. After a journey, this is a place to exchange what you have seen."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "alpha"
    },
    {
      "id": "britain_smith",
      "role": [
        "王城铁匠",
