        154.8
      ],
      "yaw": 0.4,
      "lines": [
        [
          "铁器也会疲惫。这里打磨刀锋、修补铠甲，但不会改变你现在的装备。",
          "Even iron grows tired. We tend blades and armor here; your current equipment will not be changed."
        ],
        [
          "炉边的水桶用来淬火，墙上的旧剑则属于再也没有归来的骑士。",
          "The water barrel is for quenching. The old swords on the wall belonged to knights who never returned."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "britain"
    },
    {
      "id": "britain_stable_keeper",
      "role": [
        "马厩看守",
        "Stable Keeper"
      ],
      "position": [
