        160.8
      ],
      "yaw": -0.4,
      "lines": [
        [
          "马厩的西侧留着宽走道。草料和清水已备好，长途赶路后应该让坐骑休息。",
          "The west aisle is kept clear. Fodder and fresh water are ready; mounts deserve rest after a long ride."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "britain"
    },
    {
      "id": "britain_abbey_keeper",
      "role": [
