        "Abbey Keeper"
      ],
      "position": [
        -898,
        5.501125745773315,
        142.9
      ],
      "yaw": 0,
      "lines": [
        [
          "修院的屋顶早已坍塌，晚钟却仍有人记得。请从中间的通道慢慢走进去。",
          "The abbey roof fell long ago, but someone still remembers its evening bell. The central aisle is open."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "britain"
    },
