      ],
      "yaw": 0,
      "lines": [
        [
          "这里登记每一批进港货物。账本上的空白，有时比墨迹更重要。",
          "Every inbound cargo is recorded here. A blank ledger line can matter more than the ink."
        ],
        [
          "正门通向查验厅，东侧是封存库房。后巷还连着一条货运通道。",
          "The front opens into the inspection hall. The bonded room is east, with a cargo passage behind it."
        ]
      ],
      "region": "blacksail"
